<title>USA: CME weekly pork belly out-of-town estimates.</title>
<headline>CME weekly pork belly out-of-town estimates.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimate Tuesday's CME weekly out-of-town cold storage report will show a net movement of unchanged to out 750,000 lbs.</p>
<p>This compares with a net out-movement of 1.104 million lbs a week ago and an out-movement of 3.321 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The report will be released at 1330 CDT.</p>
<p>--Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725</p>
</text>
